  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INNOVATIVE YOUNG SCIENTISTS KENYA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will support Young Scientist Kenya (YSK) on STEM outreach, Exhibition and boot camps. YSK aims to reach approximately 30,000 students in 300 schools across the country, with an increased focus on marginalized areas and special needs schools. YSK&#x2019;s activities will focus on sustainability under the theme &#x201c;Using STEM to Drive towards a Sustainable Future&#x201d;. YSK aims to take a targeted approach to reach 600 &#x2013; 1200 students per county during the outreach and mentorship program in 21 counties, with a focus on the underserved areas and marginalised groups such as girls, refugees and learners with special needs (PWDs)</narrative>
  </description>
